Subject: [PATCH 0957/3799] soh: rename func_809EEAF8 ->
 EnDivingGame_FinishAwardingScale

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: after the get-item, clears the minigame counters, sets EVENTCHKINF_OBTAINED_SILVER_SCALE and returns the actor to EnDivingGame_Reset.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Diving_Game/z_en_diving_game.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
